#
# knot.obj - Warped loop
#
# Geometry:   in the library's axes, x right, y down and z away, in eye
#             distances of bodyring's projection. A closed tube bent into a
#             loop about 3.1 across and 2.9 tall, leaning out of its plane,
#             fattest at the upper right and thinnest at the lower left,
#             with a small hole off the middle.
# Components: 192 vertices, 16 squashed rings of 12 around the loop, 192 UV
#             coordinates, which nothing reads, 192 vertex normals, and 384
#             triangular faces.
# Used by:    bodyring, as the mirror the torso and the ring reflect in.
#
